128
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:31,477
The script can state a personal choice and
compare documented traits.

129
00:07:31,477 --> 00:07:35,320
It cannot convert that choice into a
scientific fact or imply routine danger to

130
00:07:35,320 --> 00:07:37,120
humans where no such evidence exists.

131
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:42,931
The scariest deep-sea creature is partly
an animal and partly the story our brain

132
00:07:42,931 --> 00:07:44,150
